  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Card for JetClass-II\n\t\n\nJetClass-II is a large-scale and comprehensive dataset covering extensive large-radius jet signatures and a wide range of jet pTp_\\mathrm{T}pT\u200b and mass values.\nThe dataset is designed to develop large and comprehensive jet models, intended for various applications, to support extensive physics searches and measurements at the Large Hadron Collider (LHC) and beyond.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Details\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Description\n\t\n\n\n\nThe dataset consists of three\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/jet-universe/jetclass2.",
